OL,3,GNEWSAHotelier not involved in billing, 
OL,4,Afraud trial told                       
OL,6,FA hotel owner accused of dodging water 
OL,7,Fbills for nine years has told a jury he
OL,8,Fdid not know who his supplier was.     
OL,10,FSheikh Abid Gulzar, 81, of the Albany  
OL,11,FLions Hotel on Grand Parade in         
OL,12,FEastbourne, denies 10 counts of fraud, 
OL,13,Fincluding that he fraudulently avoided 
OL,14,F#160,000 of water bills across three of
OL,15,Fhis hotels in East Sussex.             
OL,17,FHe accused his co-defendant, Manasdeep 
OL,18,FSingh, at Lewes Crown Court in Brighton
OL,19,Fof doing business behind his back and  
OL,20,Fsigning deals without his consent.     
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
